#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:5 d506dfa83e9448418b0fec72f1395cf9
msgid "EKF Failsafe"
msgstr "EKF 故障保护"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:7 b3737577d22f41d6bce636f3f1a223e9
msgid ""
"The EKF failsafe monitors the health of EKF (the position and attitude "
"estimation system) to catch problems with the vehicle's position estimate "
"(caused by compass errors or velocity estimate errors) and prevent "
"\"swimaways\"."
msgstr ""
"EKF 故障保护监控 EKF（位置与姿态估计系统）的健康状态，以捕获飞行器位置估计的问题（由罗盘误差或速度估计误差引起），并防止 「游走」。"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:10 9fe87528bb544aabbea2cfda2b576e5b
msgid "When will it trigger?"
msgstr "何时触发？"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:12 d98181304d64488b9100bb8a708c0979
msgid ""
"The EKF failsafe will trigger when any two of the EKF \"variances\" for "
"compass, position or velocity are higher than the :ref:`FS_EKF_THRESH "
"<FS_EKF_THRESH>` parameter value for 1 second."
msgstr ""
"当罗盘、位置或速度的任意两项 EKF「方差」超过 :ref:`FS_EKF_THRESH <FS_EKF_THRESH>` 参数值持续 1 秒时，EKF"
" 故障保护将触发。"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:14 245b13b9e21d40c597bdc0617acf771a
msgid ""
"These \"variances\" come from the EKF itself and are numbers indicating the "
"EKF's confidence in its estimates.  The values are between 0 and 1 with 0 "
"meaning the estimate is very trustworthy and 1.0 is very untrustworthy."
msgstr ""
"这些「方差」来自 EKF 本身，表示 EKF 对其估计值的置信度。值介于 0 到 1 之间，0 表示估计值非常可靠，1.0 表示非常不可靠。"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:16 f8d1b4bce84e4a539e21c2b344f08527
msgid ""
"The EKF calculates these \"variances\" by comparing the results from "
"multiple sensors.  So for example, if the GPS position suddenly jumps but "
"the accelerometers do not show a sudden acceleration, the EKF variance for "
"position would climb (i.e become less trustworthy)"
msgstr ""
"EKF 通过比较多个传感器的结果来计算这些「方差」。例如，如果 GPS 位置突然跳变但加速度计未显示突然加速，则 EKF "
"的位置方差将升高（即变得不那么可信）。"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:18 eaf0fb37e8d543cc8168d70f6bf1cf62
msgid ""
"The variances can be viewed in real-time on the ground station.  If using "
"Mission Planner click on the \"EKF\" label on the HUD."
msgstr "方差可在地面站实时查看。如果使用 Mission Planner，请单击 HUD 上的「EKF」标签。"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:25 0a08c99fd0834cc686746a94646fc569
msgid "What will happen when the failsafe triggers?"
msgstr "故障保护触发后会发生什么？"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:27 27b33219f6d4473790b23d96253269c6
msgid ""
"The autopilot's `LED will flash red-yellow or blue-yellow and the tone-alarm"
" will sound "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=j-CMLrAwlco&feature=player_detailpage&t=60s>`__"
msgstr ""
"自动驾驶仪的 `LED 将闪烁红黄色或蓝黄色，并发出音调报警 "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=j-CMLrAwlco&feature=player_detailpage&t=60s>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:28 a3aeafac004745268e5c4a8f1d5f369c
msgid ""
"\"EKF variance\" will appear on the ground station's HUD if telemetry is "
"connected"
msgstr "如果遥测已连接，地面站 HUD 上将显示「EKF variance」（EKF 方差）"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:29 a2a2dd4f1af54bbf8b95c852859fa280
msgid ""
"In manual flight modes that do not require position (i.e. Stabilize, Acro, "
"AltHold) nothing further will happen but the pilot will be unable to switch "
"into autonomous flight modes (PosHold, Guided, Auto) until the failure "
"clears"
msgstr ""
"在不需要位置的手动飞行模式下（如 "
"Stabilize、Acro、AltHold），不会进一步触发任何操作，但飞手将无法切换到自主飞行模式（PosHold、Guided、Auto），直到故障消除。"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:30 7132392111db48cda1ac3d324289a159
msgid ""
"In autonomous modes that require position (i.e. PosHold, Guided, Auto, etc) "
"the :ref:`FS_EKF_ACTION <FS_EKF_ACTION>` controls the behaviour.  By default"
" this is \"0\" meaning the vehicle will take no action. \"1\" will send a "
"GCS warning message. \"2\" will Disarm the sub."
msgstr ""
"在需要位置的自主模式下（如 PosHold、Guided、Auto 等），:ref:`FS_EKF_ACTION <FS_EKF_ACTION>` "
"控制行为。默认值为 「0」，表示飞行器不采取任何动作；「1」将向地面站发送警告；「2」将锁定水下机器人。"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:31 1cb1d8e0dd1444c29689df0f637bf520
msgid "An EKF failsafe error will be written to the dataflash logs"
msgstr "EKF 故障保护错误将写入数据闪存日志"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:33 0e83428f0c754d4a8725e05266ee44fb
msgid ""
"After an EKF failsafe occurs, the pilot can re-take control (using the "
"flight mode switch) in a manual flight mode such as :ref:`AltHold "
"<altholdmode>` to bring the vehicle home."
msgstr ""
"EKF 故障保护触发后，飞手可通过飞行模式开关切换到手动飞行模式（如 :ref:`AltHold "
"<altholdmode>`）重新接管控制权，将飞行器驶回。"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:36 b456d7aab43d4cfba1c98ad0330adf71
msgid "Adjusting the Sensitivity of the failsafe"
msgstr "调整故障保护灵敏度"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:38 aac1302d071f402db6a0956704dded04
msgid ""
"The :ref:`FS_EKF_THRESH <FS_EKF_THRESH>` parameter can be adjusted to "
"control the sensitivity of the failsafe"
msgstr ":ref:`FS_EKF_THRESH <FS_EKF_THRESH>` 参数可用于调整故障保护的灵敏度"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:40 aaa5185c285d46b893c3510a1821f7b5
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`FS_EKF_THRESH <FS_EKF_THRESH>` = 0 to disable the EKF failsafe"
msgstr "将 :ref:`FS_EKF_THRESH <FS_EKF_THRESH>` 设为 0 可禁用 EKF 故障保护"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:41 7fe21061f3d8480caa6e2f4107d66e7f
msgid ""
"Increase :ref:`FS_EKF_THRESH <FS_EKF_THRESH>` to values between 0.8 and 1.0 "
"to reduce the chance of an EKF failsafe.  The downside of increasing this "
"parameter value is that during a flyaway caused by a bad compass or "
"positioning glitch, the vehicle will swim further away before the failsafe "
"is activated."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`FS_EKF_THRESH <FS_EKF_THRESH>` 提高至 0.8 到 1.0 之间的值，可降低 EKF "
"故障保护触发概率。提高此参数值的代价是：在因罗盘故障或定位异常导致失控游走时，飞行器将游走更远距离后才激活故障保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:42 0a846b5cd11944979f09ec9ee5a8b2d3
msgid ""
"Decrease :ref:`FS_EKF_THRESH <FS_EKF_THRESH>` to values as low as 0.6 to "
"increase the chance of an EKF failsafe triggering quickly.  The downside of "
"lowering this value is the EKF failsafe could trigger during aggressive "
"maneuvers"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`FS_EKF_THRESH <FS_EKF_THRESH>` 降低至 0.6 左右，可提高 EKF "
"故障保护快速触发的概率。降低此值的代价是在大机动飞行时可能误触发 EKF 故障保护。"
